From f196d83be2cc42e700bbdc7af3d187437517ef2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:52:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Cards: Apple TV-only pickers, optional copy button, Open
 in Stremio script

- editor quick-picks and entity picker list only apple_tv platform entities
  (custom entries still allowed)
- show_copy_button: false hides the Copy URL button in the stream dialog
- open_in_stremio_script runs an HA script instead of the stremio:// link
  (e.g. turn on the TV and open the Stremio app)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019RannaXh39jzCruFEkvtPf
